:: Tp pad 1 purchase {"position":"1850,1775","size":"100,100"}
You get closer to the Teleportation pad to see a screen popup infront of you...

"You need to buy access to the Teleportation pad to use it."

<div class="UIButtons">
<<button "Buy access to the teleportation pad. | 1000 coins">>
<<if $Coins >= 1000>>
<<set $Coins -= 1000>>
<<set $tppadONE to true>>
<<goto "Town centre">>
<<elseif $tppadONE == true>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You already bought the house!");
<</script>>
<<elseif $Coins <= 999>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You dont have enough coins!");
<</script>>
<</if>>
<</button>>
</div>

[[Go back|Town centre]]


